<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.70 /10.60   11.40 /11.30   11.85 /11.75</p>
<p> BPI		     10.65 /10.50   11.275/11.15   11.80 /11.65</p>
<p> Citibank		11.00 /10.875  11.40 /11.25   11.90 /11.75</p>
<p> HongKong Bank	 10.85 /10.65   11.40 /11.25   11.80 /11.65</p>
<p> Multinational	 10.70 /10.40   11.30 /11.15   11.80 /11.55</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     10.85 /10.60   11.25 /11.10   11.80 /11.60</p>
<p> Solidbank	     10.70 /10.50   11.40 /11.20   11.90 /11.70</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
